        "comments": "The assembly drTroVert1.hap1.2 is based on 81x PacBio data and Arima2 Hi-C data generated by the Darwin Tree of Life Project\n(https://www.darwintreeoflife.org/). The assembly process included the following sequence of steps: initial PacBio assembly generation with Hifiasm in Hi-C integrated assembly mode, and Hi-C based scaffolding with YaHS. The mitochondrial and plastid genomes were assembled using OATK. Finally, each haplotype assembly was analysed and manually improved using TreeVal. Chromosome-scale scaffolds confirmed by the Hi-C data have been named in order of size. The exact order and orientation of the contigs on chromosome 8 (7,400 - 13,153 Kbp) are unknown. The exact order and orientation of the contigs on chromosome 2 (33,736 - 39,000 Kbp) are unknown. The exact order and orientation of the contigs on chromosome 5 (15,350 - 24,300 Kbp) are unknown. The exact order and orientation of the contigs on chromosome 2 (33,736 - 39,000 Kbp) are unknown. The exact order and orientation of the contigs on chromosome 1 (24,600 - 37,250 Kbp) are unknown. The exact order and orientation of the contigs on chromosome 10 (25,800 - 29,000 & 33,133 - 42,250 Kbp) are unknown.",
